Reused/adapted source:
- src/upstream/financial-table-utils.ts: upstream formatting utilities, retained.
- server/upstream/financial-tools.mjs: FinancialToolsManager, tool-call cache and
  named financial tools, adapted to injected public-data providers and JSON schema.
- src/components/Cards.tsx / FinancialTable: adapted metric-row/report-column
  organization, missing-field filtering and formatter separation from
  components/financial-table-base.tsx; UI primitives replaced with HeroUI.

Source reference snapshots are retained under upstream-reference/. These are not
part of the application build. Next.js authentication, PostgreSQL and Financial
Datasets endpoints are not used by the local build. Express/Vite bootstrapping,
streaming transport, research cards, citations, deterministic scenarios, source
validation and report compilation are local adaptations/additions. Shared data
adapters and PDF parsing are carried over from the prior local 研迹 project.

Do not interpret this adaptation as the upstream project's official distribution.

2026-10 architecture update:
- Agent runtime is separated into LLM, Tools, Memory and Loop modules.
- DeepFinance (https://github.com/wig123/DeepFinance, inspected commit f725744)
  informed the document/research-gap/report/evidence-side-panel interaction design.
  No DeepFinance source files are copied into this application.
- No HelloAgents SDK is bundled; the four-layer organization is a conceptual and
  implementation responsibility split, not a framework certification claim.

2026-10 Python migration:
Production backend is ported to Python/FastAPI under backend/yanji/. Tool descriptions and policies retain prior adaptation contracts. server/ and tests/ are preserved for regression and rollback; Python does not delegate backend business execution to Node.

Public source snapshot:
- Exported from the private development project without its Git history or README.
- Runtime databases, uploaded files, credentials and personal interview notes are excluded.
- Legacy credential import requires explicit YANJI_IMPORT_LEGACY_SETTINGS=1.
